---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Refund Policy" description="BhaktiMedia.in — Refund Policy.">
<div class="container-x px-4 pb-20 pt-32 sm:px-6">
  <header class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Refund <span class="text-gradient">Policy</span></h1>
    <p class="mt-2 font-dev text-sm text-golden/80">॥ प्रतिदान नीतिः ॥</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-sandal-deep/60 dark:text-cream/50">Last updated: 23 September 2026</p>
  </header>

  <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-sandal-deep/80 dark:text-cream/75">
    <section class="rounded-2xl border border-golden/25 bg-saffron/5 p-6 dark:bg-saffron/10">
      <p class="font-display text-base font-bold text-saffron">TL;DR — Saral Shabdon Mein</p>
      <p class="mt-2">Digital goods (AI-generated images, posters, videos) generally cannot be refunded once delivered — kyunki wo aapke liye custom ban chuke hain. <b>Lekin agar humse galti hui ho (technical failure, wrong delivery, quality issue), hum 100% credit ya rework dete hain.</b></p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">1. Eligibility for Refund / Credit</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">Refund or credit may be issued in these specific cases:</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6">
        <li><b>Technical failure:</b> Payment deducted but credits not delivered — within 48 hours</li>
        <li><b>AI generation failure:</b> Repeated errors prevent generation — within 7 days of purchase</li>
        <li><b>Wrong delivery:</b> You received content you didn't order</li>
        <li><b>Quality issue:</b> Output significantly deviates from the template preview shown (not personal taste)</li>
        <li><b>Duplicate charge:</b> You were charged twice for the same plan/credits</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">2. Not Eligible for Refund</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6">
        <li>Change of mind after using credits or downloading creations</li>
        <li>Dissatisfaction with prompt-based output (AI results vary by prompt quality)</li>
        <li>Subscription renewal not cancelled before billing date</li>
        <li>Credits used or partially used</li>
        <li>Custom services already delivered (voiceovers, video edits, branding)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">3. How to Request</h2>
      <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-6">
        <li><a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-saffron hover:underline">Contact us</a> within <b>7 days</b> of the transaction</li>
        <li>Include: email used, transaction/invoice ID, and brief description of the issue</li>
        <li>If possible, attach a screenshot of the issue</li>
        <li>Our team responds within 24-48 hours</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">4. Resolution Options</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">In eligible cases, we offer (in your preference order):</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6">
        <li><b>Credit bonus:</b> Extra credits added to your account (fastest, most common)</li>
        <li><b>Free rework:</b> We regenerate / re-edit at no extra cost</li>
        <li><b>Full refund:</b> Back to original payment method (Razorpay processes in 5-7 working days)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">5. Subscription Cancellation</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">Cancel anytime from your dashboard — no questions asked. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing cycle. No pro-rata refund for partial months, but you keep access until cycle ends.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">6. Our Commitment</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">BhaktiMedia is a seva-first studio. If you're unhappy for any reason — even those not covered above — please talk to us before escalating. We'd rather make it right than lose a devotee-customer. 🪔</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">7. Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">Refund requests: <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-saffron hover:underline">Contact us</a> — mention "Refund" in the subject line for priority handling.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>